msgstr "Waduh, si manjaku malang banget, jadi sendirian!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
msgctxt "tb58226ef9d"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`cute`
msgctxt "td62a2a62c2"
msgid "Allez, ne t'en fais pas, je m'occuperai de toi ce soir si tu veux !"
msgstr "Ayolah, santai aja, aku bakal urusin kamu malam ini kalo mau!"

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`angry`
msgctxt "t9c1da4a599"
msgid "Objection !"
msgstr "Keberatan!"

#. Character:`kimochi`
msgctxt "t9032303c74"
